DECISIONS 163, WIRE.md §3: a bare load reports the raw-byte E7105 at a byte of the file as written, its
\r\n line ends counted, not at a byte of the folded content.
-- call --
load("data/a.json")
-- data/a.json --
{"label":

�}
-- findings.txt --
error[E7105]  data/a.json:3:1
  data/a.json is not valid UTF-8 at byte 13

